hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab Jume ka din hota hai to farishte har darwaze par baithte hain, logon ko pehle phir pehle likhte hain. Phir jab imam [khutbe ke liye] baithta hai to saheefe lapet dete hain aur khutba sunte hain. To namaz ki taraf sawere jane wala goya oont ki qurbani dene wala hai, phir jo us ke ba'd hai goya gae ki qurbani dene wala, aur jo us ke ba'd hai goya mendhe ki qurbani dene wala, aur jo us ke ba'd hai goya [kisi cheez] ki qurbani dene wala', yahan tak ke Aap ne murghi aur ande ka zikr kiya."
"155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab Jume ka din hota hai to farishte masjid ke darwazon par baithte hain, logon ko pehle phir pehle likhte hain. To [pehle aane wala] goya oont ki qurbani dene wala hai, phir goya gae ki qurbani dene wala, phir goya mendhe ki qurbani dene wala, phir goya murghi ki qurbani dene wala, phir goya ande ki qurbani dene wala. Phir jab imam nikalta hai to saheefe lapet dete hain aur baith kar zikr [khutba] sunte hain.'"
"156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo Jume ke din janabat ke ghusl ki tarah ghusl kare, phir [sawere] jae to goya us ne oont qurban kiya; aur jo dusri ghadi mein jae to goya us ne gae qurban ki; aur jo teesri ghadi mein jae to goya us ne seengon wala mendha qurban kiya; aur jo chauthi ghadi mein jae to goya us ne murghi qurban ki; aur jo paanchwin ghadi mein jae to goya us ne anda qurban kiya. Phir jab imam nikalta hai to farishte hazir hote hain aur zikr [khutba] sunte hain.'"
